    {
      "Original": "Waymark Studio Config",
      "Translated": "突进目标工作室配置",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow..ctor",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Replace Native Waymarks UI",
      "Translated": "替换原生突进目标界面",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Clear waymark when beginning placement",
      "Translated": "开始放置时清除突进目标",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Clear already placed waymark when beginning the place the same waymark.\nFor example, when you click the 'A' button to start placing it, the 'A' waymark will be removed if it's already been placed.\nThe game's default UI clears waymarks, but '/waymark' does not.",
      "Translated": "开始放置同一突进目标时，清除已放置的该突进目标。\n例如，当你点击“A”按钮开始放置时，如果“A”突进目标已存在，它将被移除。\n游戏默认界面会清除突进目标，但“/waymark”不会。",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Combine Equivalent Duty Presets (V&C Dungeons)",
      "Translated": "合并等效任务预设（多变迷宫与幻境迷宫）",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Show V&C Dungeon presets in all forms of the content (variant, advanced, criterion, criterion savage).",
      "Translated": "在所有内容形式中显示多变迷宫与幻境迷宫预设（多变、进阶、异闻、异闻零式）。",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Disable World Preset Placement Safety Checks",
      "Translated": "禁用世界预设放置安全检查",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Disable distance, height, and frequency safety checks when placing presets in the open world / non-instance areas.\nWith this disabled, your preset placement will be obviously impossible; use at your own risk.",
      "Translated": "在开放世界/非副本区域放置预设时，禁用距离、高度和频率安全检查。\n禁用后，你的预设放置将明显不可能实现；请自行承担风险。",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "[TESTING] Enable waymark VFX tracking",
      "Translated": "[测试] 启用突进目标特效追踪",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "VFX tracking allows you to tune VFX visibility. There are no known issues with this feature, but it has caused the game to crash in the past. Use at your own risk; please report any issues.\nNote that waymarks placed before enabling this feature are not tracked and cannot be tuned.",
      "Translated": "特效追踪允许你调整特效可见性。此功能没有已知问题，但过去曾导致游戏崩溃。请自行承担风险；如有问题请报告。\n注意，启用此功能之前放置的突进目标不会被追踪，也无法调整。",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
